  <item>
    <title>Vol 18. 当我们谈论“烂掉”时，我们在谈论波杰克</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694097272a383da1674ea36b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694097272a383da1674ea36b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Dec 2025 00:02:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：菠萝，Amber（感谢Amber的努力发声！ ）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：这次偷懒，感谢菠萝和ai软件的主导完成了第一波剪辑！我主扫尾。</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：AI创作：我请教dola+菠萝请教豆包hhh （关于封面彩蛋，请往下拉）</span></p><span></span><p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>各位，真的是好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么是“烂掉”呢？</span><br><span>它不是一次突兀的失败，也不是道德意义上的坠落，</span><br><span>而是一种在时间中缓慢展开的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>即使在这种状态里，人并未停止生活。</span><br><span>只是有些人逐渐失去处理痛苦的能力，</span><br><span>对自身价值的信任开始松动，</span><br><span>对生活意义的判断变得迟疑、含混。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们以《马男波杰克》作为观察对象，</span><br><span>试图讨论人，是如何在日复一日中，慢慢烂掉的？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们会谈他的童年、他的名气、他的自我厌恶；</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈那些看似无关紧要、却一步步把人推向深渊的选择；&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈逃避如何变成习惯，自欺如何被包装成“性格”， 以及伤害他人、自责、再自毁的循环，如何让一个人不断向内塌陷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>重点从不在于波杰克“做错了什么”，</span><br><span>而在于他如何一点点失去自我修正的可能。</span></p><span></span><p><span>事实上，《马男波杰克》提供的不是希望叙事，而是一种更现实的视角：</span><br><span>有些人能够变好，</span><br><span>有些人不能。</span><br><span>而“不能”，并非戏剧性的失败，</span><br><span>而是时间与选择共同累积的结果。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果改变并非必然，</span><br><span>那么“每天不那么坏一点”，是否仍然有意义？</span><br><span>当一个人已经开始烂掉，</span><br><span>“拯救”这个词，是否仍然适用？</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于封面彩蛋：</span></p><span></span><p><span>痛失姓名的另一张封面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXG8DGRju0-pZ35GMVpBgbL7Pix.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkpZ1nfZodNx4QXzQGBG1AZ2MbC_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frrfd_UQ9A0EV0gHd6y0vYsvwD2C.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>: 彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a>: Back in the 90's - Grouplove (bgm)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a>: 好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>: 为什么用“烂掉”而不是“堕落/失败”？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>烂掉的起点&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a>: 他的“烂掉”早到他可能都不知道那就是伤害。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a>：摧毁人的第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a>: "冒犯“一下成功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a>: 他从来不直视痛苦，所以痛苦越来越大&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a>: 被关注的需求与展现“烂”的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a>: 过去的烂事就像是一个永远甩不掉的幽灵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>: 羞耻也是一种自我攻击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a>: 自说自话 VS 逃避</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a>: 房子，痛苦的投射与自毁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a>: 烂掉的人有变好的可能吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2994">49:54</a>: 这也可以是压倒骆驼的最后一根稻草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3328">55:28</a>: 如果你周围有人烂掉了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a>: "可怕“的设想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3734">01:02:14</a>: 所以一个人是怎么变烂的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3852">01:04:12</a>: 下期再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3734">01:02:14</a> : Mr. Bleu - Catherine Feeny (bgm)&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65f447721755471a48e545cf/ljZAQx6fOolPwx9o-tSWuTWuTWOl.m4a" length="63010836" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmMzvifCgsY12h--OIYP3VXd9ec2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol 17. 勇者游戏之朝圣之旅：走到尽头还是路的一部分（葡萄牙朝圣线）！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683cc6c238dcc57c64116bf7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683cc6c238dcc57c64116bf7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jun 2025 22:22:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Carrie, 教授</span></p><span></span><p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>各位，真的是好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>一张朝圣护照、一双登山鞋、一条几百公里的葡萄牙路线，还有几个试图“边走边破解生活副本”的普通玩家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是一次“现实版勇者游戏”通关日志——我们边走边聊，聊朝圣路上的崩溃，笑意与不期而至的相遇，是如何一点点拆掉了我们原本的边界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>行走的是身体，被改变的却是地图以外的部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有时我们不知道自己为什么出发，也不确定走到哪里算“抵达”。但每一步，终究都带我们靠近自己一点点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些旅途分享：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Carrie版：</span></p><span></span><p><span>（感谢Carrie同意出镜！这是她坐船横穿葡萄牙和西班牙的一天，还下着雨哈哈哈哈）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtZVki1izN12PwiiSk1PCkGhCrWe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>装备篇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmjw5P9VqvpGbpTT16s4jcJEI5IC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgBWFFnzKwJXqlm3gnfd7L0laz-y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>和好朋友Mike的吃吃吃之旅！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv--lZPPSc3fbzx3R4qQIMk4h4uG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小五版：</span></p><span></span><p><span>（德国怨种必须有姓名）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFLJhWk11yIkmvDLs1RkDS0mK2v.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>朝圣之旅大结局</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoLw3noEM_74T3kRd0qjqvQHIZTw.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>崩溃的走了11小时后遇见了彩虹！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkmcfni046h-D4bC6WYTE0D42crC.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>“世界的尽头”：0.00km</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhi9EkUK7MRzf7-C6M0qNdl0VpzR.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>: 彩蛋&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>: 与你到永久- 伍佰 （bgm)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a>: 好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>: 提问！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a>: 崩溃的开始之沼泽篇！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a>: 开始放飞自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a>: 每日乳法（bushi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a>: 德国怨种篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a>: 不同的朝圣之旅准备篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a>：野niào野shi篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a>: 绿头发传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a>: 可怜的Eric篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>: 不一样的朝圣之旅人格！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a>: 朝圣之旅中的社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">01:04:00</a>: “你的感受其实是你自己决定的。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">01:07:30</a>: 走出自信走出强大（bushi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">01:08:40</a>: 出门在外身份是自己给的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4240">01:10:40</a>: “更多的自由”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">01:15:00</a>: 结局的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5130">01:25:30</a>: 搞笑的乌龙事件之人的悲喜果然不相同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5520">01:32:00</a>: 面具与陌生人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6000">01:40:00</a>: 你还会再一次走朝圣之旅吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6403">01:46:43</a>: 最后一个问题之对你来说朝圣之旅最重要的是什么？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6590">01:49:50</a>: 那我们下期再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6590">01:49:50</a>: 平凡之路-朴树（bgm)</span></p>]]></description>
