    <guid isPermaLink="false">673a4e00f373fe5d4d0a0454</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 23:01:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Amber</span></p><span></span><p><span>简介：@Amber</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello朋友们，真的是好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期又是相对来说比较“小众”和碎碎念的，让我们一起来聊聊《迷宫饭》吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>《迷宫饭》作为一部非传统的美食番，同时也兼具了RPG的基础设定，从世界观到人物设定上都有很多值得分析和讨论的内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果感兴趣的话，欢迎加入小五和Amber的深夜探讨！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5_ESg-GlYd_8gRktsnsh704WEA.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>主角团之种族变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>: Sleep Walking Orchestra - BUMP OF CHICKEN（bgm)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a>: 进入主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a>: 动画 vs 漫画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>: 迷宫饭 vs 传统RPG作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>: 迷宫饭中的反传统RPG设定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a>: “日本武士”痛失名字！（bushi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a>: 漫画里的主角团核心人物究竟是谁?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a>: 莱欧斯的对照组：这才是传统RPG作品主角的人设吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a>: 法琳的悲剧性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a>: 漫画里的灵魂人物究竟是谁?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2627">43:47</a>: 希斯路的疯狂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a>: 魔神的三种形态讨论： 猪，山羊与翼狮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3728">01:02:08</a>: 莱欧斯的工具人属性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3942">01:05:42</a>: 论主角团的社会化程度排序</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4125">01:08:45</a>: 法琳的痛点是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4625">01:17:05</a>: 必要条件下莱欧斯会选择做汉尼拔吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4850">01:20:50</a>: 莱欧斯的狗绳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4940">01:22:20</a>: 谁才是最适合做黄金国国王的人呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5200">01:26:40</a>: 令你印象深刻的迷宫美食！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5635">01:33:55</a>: 吃是生命的特权！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5659">01:34:19</a>: キラキラの灰 - Regallily (bgm)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjjI78ucxV-xLLIAednuoWD5a_fy.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
