    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Amber, 菠萝，镜天</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提醒：因为网络和设备的原因，所以录音效果可能不太稳定，另，本期有成人话题预警。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello朋友们，好久不见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接上期，在讨论了对另外一个性别的刻板印象以及对方眼中的性别优势之后，我们将聊聊同一个事件下，基于性别产生的不同视角，对另一个性别的恐惧以及作为人，作为女性和男性的共性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以《二手时代》的一段摘抄作为这个主题的结尾：</span><em><strong><span>巨大的阴暗，欲望的阴暗，蛰伏于人类生命中的本能，而我们对这种生活只有模糊的认识</span></strong></em><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢各位的收听，本期依旧是非常的peace and love。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于开头bgm : Kid - 法国歌手Eddy de Pretto的歌曲，以男性的视角来控诉与讽刺父权，毕竟，在这个制度下，人人都可能是受害者：女人，男人，成人和小孩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客于小宇宙，豆瓣，苹果播客同步更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> ： 前情提要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:00:31</a>: Kid - Eddy de Pretto (bgm)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a>: 针对“直男”和“直女”的性凝视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a>: &nbsp;“直男”恐同（的底层逻辑）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>: 男性如何面对性别凝视？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a>: 异性恐惧 vs 被排除的少数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">27:34</a>: “假姐妹”和“假兄弟”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a>: 婚姻带来的家庭结构重组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a>: &nbsp;陪葬习俗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a>: 谁真正掌握话语权？父权？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">44:24</a>: 对往期节目的吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a>: 两性如何面对平权声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3082">51:22</a>: 全年龄家具广告里的泳装女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a>: 男明星代言卫生巾广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3558">59:18</a>: 对异性的生理知识的了解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3915">01:05:15</a>: 在女权声浪下发声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4124">01:08:44</a>: 是否要帮助异性 ？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4335">01:12:15</a>: 女/ 男人就是怎么样！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4460">01:14:20</a>: “媚男”和“服美役”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">01:20:00</a>: 职业应该区分性别吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>成年人话题与跑题预警！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4910">01:21:50</a>: 男性也会遭受副驾驶坐经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4960">01:22:40</a>: 熊，姐和学历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5010">01:23:30</a>: 前口口口口和菊花超市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5115">01:25:15</a>: 月经期间为什么不可以请病假？</span></p><span></span><p><span>预警结束</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5445">01:30:45</a>: 性别隔阂从哪个环节产生 &nbsp;？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5525">01:32:05</a>: 潜移默化的社会规训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5855">01:37:35</a>: 如何摆脱性别标签与集体意识的裹挟？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6148">01:42:28</a>: &nbsp;“谁也没有准备好面对自由”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6202">01:43:22</a>: 下期再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6227">01:43:47</a>: Every color -Raveena (bgm)</span></p>]]></description>
