    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Sep 2024 15:51:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Amber，菠萝，镜天</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期简介：Amber与小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间轴：菠萝</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提醒：本期是两地四人的线上录制，由于网络和设备的原因，所以录音效果可能不太稳定，提前向朋友们道个歉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello朋友们，好久不见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如今性别议题的热度始终不退，男女两性（暂且不讨论其他性别）是相对来说最显性的区分。这期邀请了镜天、菠萝和Amber，大家一起从自身的角度来讨论一下所谓的“两性差异”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为聊得过于酣畅淋漓（前后聊了6小时左右），所以这次也会分成上下两期，上期聊了对另外一个性别的刻板印象以及对方眼中的性别优势。下期将聊聊同一个事件下，基于性别产生的不同视角，对另一个性别的恐惧以及作为人，作为女性和男性的共性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>由于是出于自身的角度来分享，可能会显得有点碎碎念（笑），感谢各位的收听，本期非常的peace and love。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于开头bgm: I Predict-老子早晓得（感谢Amber灵魂翻译）</span></p><span></span><p><span>来源于Amber看的sparks乐队的纪录片的灵感，他们早在1982年就写出了讽刺“雄性魅力”的歌（兄弟俩都是顺性别直男），歌词简单有趣却很有深意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客于小宇宙，豆瓣，苹果播客同步播放。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>: I Predict - Spark (bgm）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>: 进入正题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a>: 性别议题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a>: </span><strong><span>对性别的刻板印象</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a>: 性别优势与权利</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a>: 男人有钱就变坏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a>: “霸总与小娇妻”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a>: 男人战争的“战利品”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>: “纯洁”的交易</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a>: 被抨击的性别特质</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1743">29:03</a>: “爹味”与自我表达</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1974">32:54</a>: 下位者的自我审视</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a>: </span><strong><span>所谓的“性别优势”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a>: “职场骚扰”与着装</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a>: 男性共谋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a>: 渴女与厌女</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3706">01:01:46</a>: 特质与性别挂钩吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4030">01:07:10</a>: 性别反串</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4790">01:19:50</a>: 优势的假象</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5047">01:24:07</a>: 生育与共同产假</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5595">01:33:15</a>: 谁在挑动性别对立？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5716">01:35:16</a>: 感谢收听与下期预告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5750">01:35:50</a>: 她和她和她-于贞（bgm）</span></p>]]></description>
