    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：王光明（鼠鼠中的英俊鼠鼠王光明</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面：王光明&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>（来自王光明同学的作品：</span><em><span>I mean whole of the world 2020</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FggpQCFt7gpkUVM-Ixx1dOIukn5l.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Hello朋友们，真是好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>借着朋友王光明来我家玩的时刻，我们两个人来了一期关于艺术留学生活的即兴讨论，但没想到因为各种因素导致后期拖了超长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>果然，计划赶不上变化，笑死。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一点点干货加上很多八卦与感想，除了柴米油盐以外我们还在法国的学校有什么样的冒险呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>: 13 jours en France (Orchestre) (音乐）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a>: 一个小小的开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>：不一样的教学机制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a>: 印象深刻的课程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>: 各个美院大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a>: 学校等级就主打一个国内外信息差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a>：德国美院交换生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">28:18</a>：文化领域与经济支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a>：生活是会消灭你对艺术创作的热情的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a>：论工作与艺术创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a>：艺术留子职业的一种可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a>: &nbsp;鱼与熊掌不可兼得：大公司就是好的吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a>: 93与8区书店大比拼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a>: 八卦时间之学校间那些不可言说的事哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3783">63:03</a>: 如何抉择之法国公立和私立学校</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4088">68:08</a>: 王光明老师才艺大表演！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4164">69:24</a>: Kill Bill Vol. 1 - The whistle song (音乐）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4239">70:39</a>: 彩蛋</span></p>]]></description>
