  <item>
    <title>Vol 7. 巴黎奥运会杂谈：残夏，不止是热闹</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b8b8a233591c27be4909d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b8b8a233591c27be4909d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 13:12:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：小五</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：镜天</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello朋友们，好久不见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在是北京时间2024年8月11日<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a>分，还有几个小时，本届巴黎奥运会即将结束。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这届奥运会，可能和每一届奥运会一样，有欢笑，有泪水，有怒吼，有不甘，残夏，不止是热闹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>就着鲜活滚烫的回忆，我和镜天俩聊了聊在本届奥运会中发生的很多有趣的故事和插曲，当然也有一些适当的“老生常谈”，卖个关子不剧透，感谢各位耐心听我们唠叨～</span></p><span></span><p><span>以泰勒·斯威夫特的歌 The Alchemy（炼金术）的一段歌词献给所有值得的人：</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Alchemy（炼金术）</span></p><span></span><p><span>This happens once every few lifetimes</span></p><span></span><p><span>此情此景，不知经历多少次人生才会拥有These chemicals hit me like white wine</span></p><span></span><p><span>化学物质犹如白葡萄酒，令我深深触动</span></p><span></span><p><span>What if I told you I'm back?</span></p><span></span><p><span>倘若我告诉你我回来了又会怎样?</span></p><span></span><p><span>The hospital was a drag</span></p><span></span><p><span>在医院的经历成为累赘</span></p><span></span><p><span>Worst sleep that I ever had</span></p><span></span><p><span>所体验过最糟糕的睡眠</span></p><span></span><p><span>I circled you on a map</span></p><span></span><p><span>我在地图上圈出你的位置</span></p><span></span><p><span>I haven't come around in so long</span></p><span></span><p><span>我已经太久没有回到这里</span></p><span></span><p><span>But I'm coming back so strong</span></p><span></span><p><span>但当我回归之时 比以往都更加坚强</span></p><span></span><p><span>So when I touch down,</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以当我降临，</span></p><span></span><p><span>call the amateurs and cut 'em from the team</span></p><span></span><p><span>召集那些业余之人,再将他们踢出团体</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ditch the clowns, get the crown, baby, I'm the one to beat</span></p><span></span><p><span>摆脱跳梁小丑,夺下那顶桂冠,亲爱的,我是你需要打败的对手</span></p><span></span><p><span>'Cause the sign on your heart said it's still reserved for me</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为你心脏上的那枚印记,表明你仍在为我守候</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> ：Lil Stranger,Nightcore - Wasted （音乐）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>：一个小小的开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a>：巴黎留子的奥运会购票吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a>：“松弛感”的开幕式和绕不开的北京奥运开幕式。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a>: &nbsp;乒乓赛场涌现的“饭圈文化’</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a>：兴奋剂检测引发的争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a>：变性人参赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3075">51:15</a>：日本将《灌篮高手》成为现实以及我们真的培养不出世界级篮球后卫吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3675">01:01:15</a>：有争议性的国家女运动员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3933">01:05:33</a>：林丹与李宗伟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">01:16:00</a>：些关于奥林匹克的印象深刻的时刻以及意难平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5280">01:28:00</a>：直到世界的尽头-WANDS （音乐）</span></p>]]></description>
